# =====================================================================
# PURGED — LICENCE-RESTRICTED. MUST NEVER RE-ENTER THIS REPOSITORY.
# =====================================================================
# These were removed from ALL history with git filter-repo on 2026-09-23
# (see docs/CONSOLIDATION.md, D8). They are other parties' data,
# redistributed verbatim under licences that forbid it:
#
#   FAO GAUL (2015 and earlier) — redistribution to non-authorized users
#     is prohibited without FAO's prior written consent.
#   GADM — redistribution requires prior permission.
#
# Retrieve them from Dropbox via scripts/fetch_raw_data.sh. Never commit them.
#
# NOTE: .gitignore only stops *untracked* files being added. It does NOT
# stop a merge or `git subtree pull` from reintroducing them, because
# merges ignore these rules. scripts/check_consolidation.sh fails if any
# of these paths reappear — run it before every push.

# SUNGEO / FAO GAUL historical boundaries (18,039 files, 1.65 GB)
Spatial_Temporal_Object_1990_2014/
spatial-kg/Spatial_Temporal_Object_1990_2014/
*_GAUL[0-9][0-9][0-9][0-9]_ADM[0-9].geojson

# Original GADM distribution files
gadm41_*
*/gadm41_*

# Any original ESRI shapefile — the format GADM and GAUL ship in
*.shp
*.shx
*.dbf
*.prj
*.cpg
*.sbn
*.sbx

